d","checked":false}],"bookList":[{"bookId":"42000024152","originalBookId":"42000024152","bookName":"Goodbye, My Ungrateful Family","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024152/42000024152.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":8.4,"introduction":"Steven gave up his career for the woman he loved, only to watch her grow closer to another man. Haunted by a vision of a future where his family chooses someone else, he leaves before his heart can break. Now, the wife who ignored him will do anything to bring him home.","labels":["Winning Him Back","Love Triangle"],"tags":["Winning Him Back","Love Triangle"],"followCount":2441,"chapterCount":39,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"Goodbye-My-Ungrateful-Family","bookNameLower":"goodbye-my-ungrateful-family","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Goodbye-My-Ungrateful-Family","shelfTime":"2026-08-16 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-16 10:00:00","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"19.7K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000024768","originalBookId":"42000024768","bookName":"The Prey Who Broke My Seal ","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024768/42000024768.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":8.7,"introduction":"Elias Vale, the orphan of a fallen noble family, was publicly humiliated and abandoned at a wealthy clan’s engagement banquet for lacking a contractual mark. Adrian Blackthorne, heir to the most powerful sigil clan, stepped in to save him.Adrian thought he had picked up a delicate, beautiful prey he could easily manipulate and exploit. He offered Elias a temporary companion’s contract to help him pass his family’s inheritance trial. ","labels":["A Nobody","Contract Lover"],"tags":["A Nobody","Contract Lover"],"followCount":7340,"chapterCount":32,"typeOneIds":[22],"typeTwoIds":[197],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":197,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"The-Prey-Who-Broke-My-Seal","bookNameLower":"the-prey-who-broke-my-seal-","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Prey-Who-Broke-My-Seal-","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 20:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 20:00:00","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"13.7K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000024658","originalBookId":"42000024658","bookName":"The Wreckage We Called Love","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024658/42000024658.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":8.9,"introduction":"Adrian Carter once died saving his wife, Claire Hale. Reborn at the start of their marriage, Claire returns haunted by regret, while Adrian is consumed by old wounds. Hiding behind his secretary Sienna Hayes’s name, he pushes Claire to the brink with cruel games of revenge. When she finally chooses to leave, Adrian sees the truth too late. Will their love survive the storm of hatred, regret, and redemption?","labels":["Billionaire","Forced Love"],"tags":["Billionaire","Forced Love"],"followCount":3211,"chapterCount":60,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"The-Wreckage-We-Called-Love","bookNameLower":"the-wreckage-we-called-love","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Wreckage-We-Called-Love","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:39:25","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:39:25","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"18.5K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000024646","originalBookId":"42000024646","bookName":"Echoes of Eternity: Until the Stars Remember  ","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024646/42000024646.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":9.5,"introduction":"A forbidden love between two immortals sparks a curse spanning three lifetimes. Cast into the mortal world with no memory, he is consumed by resentment and turns on the woman he once loved. She escapes, raises their gifted child, and returns as a fearless warrior seeking revenge. When an ancient relic restores their memories, father and child become bitter enemies, while their mischievous little one schemes to reunite them.","labels":["Family Bonds","Cultivation Fantasy"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Cultivation Fantasy"],"followCount":782,"chapterCount":60,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"Echoes-of-Eternity-Until-the-Stars-Remember","bookNameLower":"echoes-of-eternity-until-the-stars-remember--","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Echoes-of-Eternity-Until-the-Stars-Remember--","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:29:53","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:29:53","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"13.8K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000023924","originalBookId":"42000023924","bookName":"Chained Wings","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023924/42000023924.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":9.3,"introduction":"Archangel Lucien and fallen lord Draven are enemies. On the battlefield, Lucien hesitates, and Draven captures him, breaks his wings, and imprisons him in darkness. Through torture and degradation, Lucien endures humiliation. He attempts escape but is caught and branded. A dark tale of obsession and captivity between two divine beings.","labels":["Fantasy","The Chosen One"],"tags":["Fantasy","The Chosen One"],"followCount":13438,"chapterCount":40,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161,291],"typeTwoNames":["Romance","Fantasy"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"},{"id":291,"name":"Fantasy","replaceName":"fantasy"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"Chained-Wings","bookNameLower":"chained-wings","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Chained-Wings","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 10:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 10:00:01","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"11.0K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000023519","originalBookId":"42000023519","bookName":"The One Scent I Can't Resist","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023519/42000023519.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":9.1,"introduction":"\"A top-tier Alpha CEO who suffers from pheromone rejection syndrome never allows any Omega to approach him—yet he unexpectedly discovers that the only pheromone he does not reject comes from his business archrival: the very man who claims to be a Beta.\"\t\t\t","labels":["Billionaire","Forced Love"],"tags":["Billionaire","Forced Love"],"followCount":15489,"chapterCount":60,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"The-One-Scent-I-Can-t-Resist","bookNameLower":"the-one-scent-i-cant-resist","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-One-Scent-I-Cant-Resist","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 10:00:00","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"16.7K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000024619","originalBookId":"42000024619","bookName":"The Husband Who Kept Two Secrets","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024619/42000024619.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":7.5,"introduction":"Six years ago, Claire Foster and Ethan Carter had one night together. She gave birth to twins but was told the boy died. Now a chef, Claire saves a boy with the same rare blood type: unaware he's her son. The boy, Ming, lives with Ethan and wants a mom. Ethan, hiding his identity, marries Claire. As they live together, Claire slowly uncovers the truth about Ethan and the child.","labels":["Second Chance","Family Bonds"],"tags":["Second Chance","Family Bonds"],"followCount":2291,"chapterCount":78,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"The-Husband-Who-Kept-Two-Secrets","bookNameLower":"the-husband-who-kept-two-secrets","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Husband-Who-Kept-Two-Secrets","shelfTime":"2026-08-13 18:16:53","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-13 18:16:53","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"16.3K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000024017","originalBookId":"42000024017","bookName":"Revenge Gone Wrong: I Kissed My Roommate","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024017/42000024017.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":7.6,"introduction":"After a sexual harassment incident drives assistant director Yoo Ji-in out of the industry, she reunites with her old friend Baek Min-woo, who has lost everything to a rental scam and a breakup. To take revenge on the director who ruined her career, Ji-in starts a fake romance video channel with Min-woo. What begins as a staged romance for revenge slowly turns into something real, as the two navigate love, revenge, and life under one roof.","labels":["Revenge","Modern"],"tags":["Revenge","Modern"],"followCount":823,"chapterCount":51,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"Revenge-Gone-Wrong-I-Kissed-My-Roommate","bookNameLower":"revenge-gone-wrong-i-kissed-my-roommate","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Revenge-Gone-Wrong-I-Kissed-My-Roommate","shelfTime":"2026-08-13 17:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-13 17:00:00","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"13.5K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000023486","originalBookId":"42000023486","bookName":"Nanny to the Mafia Single Daddy","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023486/42000023486.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":8.3,"introduction":"Mafia godfather Victor closes his heart off to love after the unexpected death of his wife. But when Jennifer, his daughter's nanny, enters his life, he finds himself losing control and giving in to feelings he never expected. As their passionate push-and-pull romance unfolds, the two must overcome misunderstandings and survive brushes with death before finally finding their way to each other.","labels":["Forbidden Love","Single Dad"],"tags":["Forbidden Love","Single Dad"],"followCount":43874,"chapterCount":62,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161,563],"typeTwoNames":["Romance","Mafia"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"},{"id":563,"name":"Mafia","replaceName":"mafia"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"Nanny-to-the-Mafia-Single-Daddy","bookNameLower":"nanny-to-the-mafia-single-daddy","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Nanny-to-the-Mafia-Single-Daddy","shelfTime":"2026-08-13 10:09:42","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-13 10:09:42","performerIdList":[11010,12172],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"11.2K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000023458","originalBookId":"42000023458","bookName":"His Hidden Melody","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023458/42000023458.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":8.2,"introduction":"After a night of losing control following her celebration banquet, music queen Kira finds herself entangled with ice hockey star Evan. Upon waking, she only wants to walk away—but is pushed back toward Evan step by step by scandals, her fiancé's betrayal, and the interests of high society. The more coldly distant she becomes, the more aggressively he pursues her. She wants to protect her reputation and career; he insists on tearing through her carefully constructed armor. ","labels":["Forced Love","Modern"],"tags":["Forced Love","Modern"],"followCount":10583,"chapterCount":40,"typeOneIds":[23],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"status":"PUBLISHED","language":"ENGLISH","free":1,"author":"","replacedBookName":"His-Hidden-Melody","bookNameLower":"his-hidden-melody","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"His-Hidden-Melody","shelfTime":"2026-08-12 19:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-12 19:00:00","performerIdList":[],"read":false,"inLibrary":false,"viewCountDisplay":"11.7K","lastUpdateTimeDisplay":"Completed"},{"bookId":"42000024434","originalBookId":"42000024434","bookName":"The Weight She Gave, the Love She Found","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024434/42000024434.jpg@w=240&h=400","ratings":9.5,"introduction":"Claire Hart, born with superhuman strength, gained 60 pounds to donate bone marrow to her fiancé. He recovered, then betrayed her for her wealthy best friend. Homeless, she saves the Ross family's young son and becomes his nanny. In their home, she regains her health. The CEO, Ethan Ross, gradually sees her true worth and falls for the resilient woman.","labels":["Second Chance","Family Bonds"],"tags":["S